  "subject": "Failed or missing traces should be treated as inconclusive.",
  "verdict": "SATISFIED",
  "unresolved_conditions": [],
  "rationale": "S005 identifies unreliable evidence as a source of misleading comparisons. Missing or failed monitoring records provide no reliable temperature history with which to discriminate among explanations, justifying inconclusive treatment of those records. This limitation does not imply that other reliable evidence or usable portions of a trace are inconclusive, and it does not assert that monitoring failures have occurred.",
